name: sim.getJointVelocity
description: Retrieves the linear or angular velocity of a joint. The velocity is a measured velocity (i.e. from one simulation step to the next), and is available for all joints in the scene
luaSynopsis: float velocity = sim.getJointVelocity(int jointHandle)
pythonSynopsis: float velocity = sim.getJointVelocity(int jointHandle)
inputs:
1. jointHandle: handle of a joint
outputs:
1. velocity: the velocity
replacedBy:
- name: velocity, class: joint, file: joint_velocity.property
